        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Dalton! You really got that extra scene for me! And it's a wire stunt to boot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you get Director Quay to agree so easily, when he wouldn't budge when I asked him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1837_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Greta personally recruited me as lead actor. Steven wouldn't dare turn down my requests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dalton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my first time in a wire rig... I'll never forget this opportunity you gave me! Okay, I have to go prepare now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1837_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, go on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dalton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1837_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Now</i> you're acting all humble? Might've even fooled me, if I didn't already know you were trying to get Steven to mess with my role behind my back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dalton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1837_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "First time in a wire rig, huh... Good to hear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dalton"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rookies should know their places. Now you'll be a good sport and take it, right? Even if you're left hanging for hours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dalton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_warehouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly! I just got another scene and I need the wire rig. Can you prepare it for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're passionate about acting. But how many extra scenes is this now? Do you even realize how much you've screwed with the schedule I made for the entire crew?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you feel even an ounce of guilt, <i>Princess</i>? I'm not changing the entire schedule again because of you. This crew doesn't revolve around you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Shelly. I'm not trying to increase your workload, honest. But Mr. Dalton said the director signed off on it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dalton did?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Shelly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He was just telling me how you have no respect for your seniors in the field. No way did he do this out of pure kindness.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The wire rig, huh?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "62_g12_dressingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, Laura! You look wonderful today! Not many actors would be so happy to do an aerial stunt!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I've never been so excited! This scene will be the only one in the movie that belongs entirely to me. I want to knock it out of the ballpark!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, aren't you just adorable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try not to get hurt though. And if you're tired, you can always come find me in my room. I'll be there all night...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Marion! Have you come to touch up Michael's makeup?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go prepare. See you later!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laura"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, see you in hell, bitch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-Don't be angry with me, Mari.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I look away for one moment and you're flirting with another woman! Are you tired of me already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been making eyes at her on the set too... If you like younger women that much, how about you let <i>her</i> do your makeup from now on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, babe, I'm serious about you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't talk to her from now on, I swear!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You swear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I swear!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm familiar with your vices by now, but this is an important time for your career. Don't screw it up, and don't let me down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Laura girl is a loud-mouthed show-off. I'm sure she's up to something. You can do better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your distance from her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No talking to her, and no physical contact. Even if she's dying right in front of you, that's none of your business... got it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He can tell from Marion's eyes that she is not joking."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
