        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's still not my turn? What's going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's something on Mr. Dalton's end, and everyone on the set's gone over. No one's giving orders now... Look, we've even got that rookie still hanging up there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, poor thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never struck me as the compassionate type. Trying to get her in bed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you know me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me go check on our poor little beauty...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I promised Mari this morning that I wouldn't approach her, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "We never said anything about her coming to me, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
