        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael looks up and sees Laura's slender frame hanging in mid-air. Her dripping sweat has formed a small puddle on the floor."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is tired, but her eyes remain strong, stinging Michael's frivolous heart."
    },
    {
        "text": "The wire rig is creaking. From experience, Michael can tell there is something wrong with it."
    },
    {
        "text": "However\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the better for me, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "She'll call for help once she realizes something's not right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be her hero and have the perfect excuse for a little t\u00eate-\u00e0-t\u00eate, all without breaking my promise to Mari.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll let her hang a little longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "62_g2_setting_rooftop",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Why aren't you calling for help, Laura? I'm right here, you know!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wiatear",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been hours, and the rope's sounding increasingly off... Where did this equipment even come from? How could it be so ancient?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that a crack around the belt? She <i>has</i> to have noticed that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I have to tell her, I have to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He walks forward, stepping in the puddle of sweat. The heat of the limelight is causing Laura to become dehydrated."
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael will never understand her determination, her passion. It is as though she is denying everything he is."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael turns around to find Marion standing in the far corner, gazing at him and the exhausted actress with cold eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Even if she's dying right in front of you, that's none of your business... got it?'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael strokes his orange ears and stops in his tracks."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Well, it really is none of my business if she chooses to suffer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's your first lesson, Laura.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never be too serious. Always put yourself first, even if you have to hurt others. That's the most important thing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wiatear"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 2,
        "ystrength": 7,
        "vibrato": 3,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Creak, creak."
    },
    {
        "text": "The rope above his head is being stretched to its limit."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still not going to call for help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
