        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the first time you've left the castle and traveled so far with the troupe, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1841_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you nervous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1841_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm fine, Master.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "The others are playing the leads. I'm just a very minor role, watching from the side in most of my scenes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the true performance unfolds before your eyes, it is not easy to resist the urge to run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've learned another lesson today, child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "Police statement on the Daremont Case:",
        "x": 220,
        "y": 270,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 800,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nAt this time, there is no evidence linking the case to the Crimson Troupe which passed through the area recently. The police has established a special task force to investigate.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "44_g6_towerterrace",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "A spire in Lupukarn, Leithanien"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clapsolo",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Claps)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "A splendid performance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've finally made a breakthrough after your first performance as the lead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "The tiny black crystal on your neck is almost perfectly hidden. The audience sees only the glamorous star, not the Infected approaching death one step at a time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your performance is increasingly mature, and your songs move the passions. There is virtually no stiffness, no pretentiousness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you complimenting me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you not going? Or do you want to stay, and take in the aftertaste of the stage?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aftertaste?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean the taste of blood?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
