    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, Mister, please let me through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innocent Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to go home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innocent Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think the Crimson Troupe can take her in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take her in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She doesn't know that her home is gone. She doesn't know that some of the people before her still have her family's blood on them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is what we'd call a fateful encounter, is it not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "As it was with you and the Troupe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you should teach her yourself. Teach her how to blend in, how to embrace a new life... how to walk the path that you have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1832_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The show goes on, even once we've left the stage?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, you remember what I said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, there is no drama like life. The aesthetics of destiny are never bound by any medium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
