    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bitterness of obsession... your emotions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A challenge to the palate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "text": "But your flashbacks have become increasingly frequent since we came to this plate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That means we're getting closer to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You noticed the strangeness of that coordinator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As did you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, she was visited by tragedy before I could extract any more clues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You used that camera assistant to break the news of the Catastrophe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was too much a coincidence for that document to show up when it did, the way it did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "When one's been in enough plays, it's not hard to realize that such an obvious clue is bound to be a trigger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dalton's death was only the beginning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The plot devices have been set, and their developments foreshadowed. The curtain has been raised, and it cannot be lowered again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the author will not appear until the story reaches the climax.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Only then can I kill him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Yawn)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful, Lucian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I mean is, be careful of yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I said, your emotions are filled with the bitterness of obsession... It's a dangerous thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "I apologize, Miss.Christine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will not have to endure it for long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
